Nothing here blocks the build. One choice departs from the issue's "Notes for the fix": the shown-preserving formula replaces raw against raw (step 1, R4803000). Anyone who wants the AI to keep exactly how far a hidden aura took a Unit below 0 would have to overturn R602's "learns nothing a player does not read off the board".
